WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.070
Hello!

00:00:01.112 --> 00:00:04.670
Business is going well, and you're opening a second or a third location?

00:00:05.013 --> 00:00:08.110
With VaraaAi, every branch lives in the same account.

00:00:08.453 --> 00:00:11.950
Each branch has its own booking page, calendar and staff.

00:00:12.553 --> 00:00:15.226
Tap Settings, and scroll down to Branches.

00:00:15.438 --> 00:00:16.986
Here you see your locations.

00:00:17.158 --> 00:00:19.306
The one you're managing now is marked Viewing.

00:00:19.618 --> 00:00:21.866
To open another, tap Add branch.

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:24.200
Fill in the new branch's details:

00:00:24.375 --> 00:00:30.200
the business name, a short description, the service category, the address, country,

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:31.800
city, and phone number.

00:00:32.229 --> 00:00:33.880
Then tap Submit application.

00:00:34.324 --> 00:00:36.440
The new branch gets its own booking page.

00:00:36.629 --> 00:00:41.480
Add its services, staff and opening hours, just as you did for your first salon.

00:00:42.115 --> 00:00:44.087
Once you have two or more branches,

00:00:44.037 --> 00:00:46.996
a Branch picker appears at the top of your dashboard.

00:00:47.459 --> 00:00:50.516
Tap it to switch between your locations, in one tap.

00:00:50.945 --> 00:00:53.636
In Settings, there's also the Chain booking page:

00:00:53.823 --> 00:00:57.396
one shared link, where customers choose a branch, then book.

00:00:57.745 --> 00:00:58.996
Now take the quiz below.
